  "name": "Subflujo: File Proxy",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## File Proxy\n\nEste workflow sirve de puente para archivos de Google Drive.\n\n**Funcionamiento**:\n1. Recibe petición GET con `file_id`\n2. Descarga el archivo de Drive (usando credencial)\n3. Responde con el archivo (stream binario)\n\n**Uso**:\n`https://TU-N8N/webhook/file-proxy?file_id=XYZ`\n\n**Seguridad**: Puedes agregar autenticación Basic Auth al Webhook si lo deseas.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 380
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ],
      "id": "sticky-info",
      "name": "Nota: Info"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "file-proxy",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook",
      "name": "Webhook: GET /file-proxy",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        340
      ],
      "webhookId": "file-proxy"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "download",
        "fileId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.query.file_id }}",
          "mode": "id"
        }
      },
      "id": "drive-download",
      "name": "Google Drive: Download",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "TU_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "binary",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-webhook",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "⚠️ **Credencial Google Drive**\n\nAsegúrate de tener una credencial\n'Google Drive account' configurada.\nSi usas Sheets, probablemente necesites\ncrear una nueva para Drive o usar la misma\nsi tiene scopes de Drive.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        500
      ],
      "id": "sticky-cred",
      "name": "Nota: Credencial"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook: GET /file-proxy": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Google Drive: Download",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Google Drive: Download": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond to Webhook",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
